<title>USA: Mazda January US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Mazda January US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mazda Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Jan 1-31, 1997     Jan 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     4,873	     5,938	    -17.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   2,651	     2,868	     -7.6</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,708	     5,469	    -13.9</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,153	     1,148	     +0.4</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26 in year-ago period.</p>
</text>
